00:29:06.941 --> 00:29:07.420
Right.

00:29:11.581 --> 00:29:12.461
Did you sprain your ankle?

00:29:12.461 --> 00:29:13.380
Did you sprain it?

00:29:13.701 --> 00:29:15.341
No, it's just too tight.

00:29:15.501 --> 00:29:16.420
It's too tight for my feet.

00:29:16.420 --> 00:29:17.741
These shoes are too tight.

00:29:18.101 --> 00:29:19.300
Bao Bao, do you want to come?

00:29:19.501 --> 00:29:21.821
I can't fight alone.

00:29:22.420 --> 00:29:23.621
It's okay, I'll play barefoot with you.

00:29:23.621 --> 00:29:24.501
I'll play barefoot with you.

00:29:25.660 --> 00:29:26.461
Barefoot.

00:29:27.180 --> 00:29:28.221
Play barefoot.

00:29:28.861 --> 00:29:29.941
It should be fine for you to wear your own shoes, right?

00:29:29.941 --> 00:29:31.060
Okay.

00:29:31.140 --> 00:29:32.380
I'll bring your shoes over for you.

00:29:33.581 --> 00:29:35.581
But you can't slow down Bao Bao's sliding speed.

00:29:35.581 --> 00:29:36.900
You can't hold her back.

00:29:37.060 --> 00:29:38.420
You must run forward with her when she's sliding.

00:29:38.420 --> 00:29:39.501
I will.

00:29:40.300 --> 00:29:41.140
Come on.

00:29:41.300 --> 00:29:42.821
Good players, get ready.

00:29:42.821 --> 00:29:44.140
Listen to the command again.

00:29:44.780 --> 00:29:46.621
Three, two, one.

00:29:46.621 --> 00:29:48.380
Heart gesture, freeze.

00:29:49.660 --> 00:29:52.020
This time it's quite standard.

00:29:54.140 --> 00:29:55.101
Listen to the command again.

00:29:55.101 --> 00:29:56.780
Three, two, one.

00:29:56.780 --> 00:29:58.020
Pat head, freeze.

00:30:03.140 --> 00:30:05.701
Okay, listen to my command again.

00:30:06.420 --> 00:30:09.140
3, 2, 1, princess carry, freeze.

00:30:16.060 --> 00:30:16.621
We won.

00:30:16.621 --> 00:30:18.540
Fortunately, I didn't wear those ice skates.

00:30:18.540 --> 00:30:19.981
How could I have managed a princess carry?

00:30:20.300 --> 00:30:21.581
Look at Zhao Yingbo.

00:30:27.861 --> 00:30:31.780
Alright, players, get ready.

00:30:31.861 --> 00:30:33.020
Listen to the command again.

00:30:33.180 --> 00:30:34.341
Listen to the command again.

00:30:35.821 --> 00:30:36.701
I touched...

00:30:39.260 --> 00:30:42.861
Our game of freeze tag is over.

00:30:50.941 --> 00:30:52.221
So much fun.

00:30:52.221 --> 00:30:53.701
I just love playing this kind of game.

00:30:58.420 --> 00:31:00.461
Although I lost, I was quite happy.

00:31:00.461 --> 00:31:00.900
Right.

00:31:05.101 --> 00:31:07.180
Wait, look at them, that's fun.

00:31:09.260 --> 00:31:10.461
Ke Yu,

00:31:10.461 --> 00:31:11.621
You can definitely play this.

00:31:11.621 --> 00:31:12.821
Do you want to give it a try?

00:31:13.461 --> 00:31:14.060
Come on.

00:31:16.300 --> 00:31:16.981
Why don't you

00:31:17.380 --> 00:31:18.060
Put your hand on Bao Bao's shoulder,

00:31:18.060 --> 00:31:19.420
Or my shoulder.

00:31:19.660 --> 00:31:19.941
It's okay.

00:31:19.941 --> 00:31:21.821
I'll put my hand on her shoulder.

00:31:22.701 --> 00:31:23.660
Go.

00:31:23.660 --> 00:31:24.501
Start.

00:31:24.701 --> 00:31:25.741
The little train starts.

00:31:26.900 --> 00:31:27.701
Wait a moment.

00:31:27.701 --> 00:31:29.941
Hold on tight to me.

00:31:34.621 --> 00:31:36.221
Isn't it too fast, buddy?

00:31:36.221 --> 00:31:38.501
Don't be afraid.

00:31:40.900 --> 00:31:42.941
Don't be afraid. We won't fall.

00:31:45.461 --> 00:31:46.821
Wait a moment. Be careful.

00:31:46.821 --> 00:31:49.020
Slow down.

00:31:49.020 --> 00:31:51.020
A bit slower.

00:31:52.621 --> 00:31:53.900
Don't pull my flesh.

00:31:53.900 --> 00:31:55.821
I'm not pulling your flesh.

00:31:55.821 --> 00:31:57.101
He's going to fall.

00:32:01.821 --> 00:32:03.020
Isn't it fun?

00:32:03.020 --> 00:32:03.821
Fun.

00:32:04.341 --> 00:32:05.260
Train head.

00:32:13.300 --> 00:32:14.821
Not so wonderful.

00:32:14.821 --> 00:32:15.741
I feel like he's going to fall.

00:32:25.540 --> 00:32:26.821
Okay.

00:32:27.260 --> 00:32:27.900
That's about it.

00:32:27.900 --> 00:32:28.741
Let's change places.

00:32:28.941 --> 00:32:30.461
Okay, we'll continue to challenge you.

00:32:30.461 --> 00:32:31.540
Bring it on.

00:32:36.140 --> 00:32:37.941
The next destination is the basketball court.

00:32:38.260 --> 00:32:39.101
Let me tell you what

00:32:39.101 --> 00:32:41.140
2.45 meters of air is like.

00:32:42.420 --> 00:32:43.380
What do we do now?

00:32:43.981 --> 00:32:44.821
Go away.

00:32:44.941 --> 00:32:45.621
Steal his ball.

00:32:45.861 --> 00:32:46.581
Steal his ball.

00:32:50.981 --> 00:32:53.260
You can't have long nails for basketball.

00:32:54.260 --> 00:32:55.341
It hurts so much.

00:32:56.380 --> 00:32:57.981
What should we do? We're still competing.

00:32:59.221 --> 00:32:59.701
Step on me.

00:32:59.981 --> 00:33:00.741
I step on him.

00:33:09.861 --> 00:33:10.741
Sit on my shoulders.

00:33:11.821 --> 00:33:13.060
I'm so tall.

00:33:33.981 --> 00:33:36.101
We have always been the strongest.

